WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.000
This whole has three equal large pieces. One is green. We have one third.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Watch the green edge. Split every large piece into two smaller equal pieces.

3
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Now there are six equal pieces altogether. Two of them are green. We have two sixths.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:39.000
The shaded length has not changed. One third and two sixths are two names for the same amount.

5
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Remember to split every piece, including the pale ones. Both numbers change together.
